    "answer": {
      "short": "$-1$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}8p-\\frac{14}{q}&=8\\left(-\\frac{3}{8}\\right)-\\frac{14}{(-7)}\\\\8p-\\frac{14}{q}&=-3-(-2)\\\\8p-\\frac{14}{q}&=-1\\end{align*}$$",
